  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of ENACT Partnership 2025- 2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the desk appraisal is to quality-assure the project document for support to ENACT 2025-2029. The appraisal will have a special focus on the status of the ENACT initiative as a multi-donor setup and the relationship to IUCN as the service provider for the ENACT Support Unit. The appraisal will follow the MFA Aid Management Guidelines (AMG), to review the draft Project Docu-ment (PD) before submission of the revised documentation to the Council for Development Coopera-tion. The appraisal will provide recommendations, where relevant, with a view to ensuring that the PD is in line with the quality standards, strategies and requirements for Danish development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
